@Host = http://127.0.0.1:9090
@Token = <access-token>
@ConversationId = <conversation-id>
@MessageId = <message-id>

### Start (or reopen) a 1:1 conversation — 201 when created, 200 when it already exists
POST {{Host}}/conversation
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json
Accept-Language: en

{
    "participantId": "<user-id>"
}

### List my conversations (newest activity first)
GET {{Host}}/conversation?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Poll: only conversations changed since the previous response's data.serverTime
GET {{Host}}/conversation?since=2026-01-01T00:00:00.000Z
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Unread badge
GET {{Host}}/conversation/unread-count
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### One conversation
GET {{Host}}/conversation/{{ConversationId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Latest messages (initial load)
GET {{Host}}/conversation/{{ConversationId}}/messages?limit=30
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Poll for new messages after the last one you have
GET {{Host}}/conversation/{{ConversationId}}/messages?after={{MessageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Load older history
GET {{Host}}/conversation/{{ConversationId}}/messages?before={{MessageId}}&limit=30
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Send a text message
POST {{Host}}/conversation/{{ConversationId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "content": "hello"
}

### Send with image attachments (field "attachments", up to 4 jpeg/png, 10MB each)
POST {{Host}}/conversation/{{ConversationId}}/messages
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=Boundary

--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="content"

look at this
--Boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="attachments"; filename="photo.png"
Content-Type: image/png

< ./photo.png
--Boundary--

### Mark the conversation as read
PATCH {{Host}}/conversation/{{ConversationId}}/read
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}

### Delete one of my own messages
DELETE {{Host}}/conversation/{{ConversationId}}/messages/{{MessageId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{Token}}
